From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] domicile: a domicile:// document fetches its own files

Blink refused fetch() on domicile:// before any loader saw it: the
scheme was standard and secure but not in the Fetch API set. The
splash's fetch("progress.json") failed, so it never left "Getting
ready". XMLHttpRequest and import() were unaffected.

- `ChromeContentRendererClient::RenderThreadStarted` registers the
  scheme with `RegisterURLSchemeAsSupportingFetchAPI`.
- `ShellURLLoaderFactory::MayReadFiles` serves the shell's and an app's
  files only to their own origin. Every frame uses the factory, so a
  site in a `<webview>` could otherwise read them with fetch() or
  XMLHttpRequest.

Verified: not built. This repository cannot build Chromium; the engine
job builds it on `crux`.
---
 chrome/renderer/BUILD.gn                          | 1 +
 chrome/renderer/chrome_content_renderer_client.cc | 9 +++++++++
 2 files changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/chrome/renderer/BUILD.gn b/chrome/renderer/BUILD.gn
index a28d0ae0..4604b0cc 100644
--- a/chrome/renderer/BUILD.gn
+++ b/chrome/renderer/BUILD.gn
@@ -154,6 +154,7 @@ static_library("renderer") {
     "//components/country_codes",
     "//components/crx_file",
     "//components/dom_distiller/content/renderer",
+    "//components/domicile:common",
     "//components/facilitated_payments/content/renderer",
     "//components/facilitated_payments/core/features",
     "//components/feed:feature_list",
diff --git a/chrome/renderer/chrome_content_renderer_client.cc b/chrome/renderer/chrome_content_renderer_client.cc
index aa5782f9..cb2613bf 100644
--- a/chrome/renderer/chrome_content_renderer_client.cc
+++ b/chrome/renderer/chrome_content_renderer_client.cc
@@ -4,6 +4,8 @@
 
 #include "chrome/renderer/chrome_content_renderer_client.h"
 
+#include "components/domicile/common/domicile_scheme.h"
+
 #include <functional>
 #include <memory>
 #include <optional>
@@ -621,6 +623,13 @@ void ChromeContentRendererClient::RenderThreadStarted() {
   WebSecurityPolicy::RegisterURLSchemeAsSupportingFetchAPI(
       WebString::FromAscii(chrome::kChromeExperimentalSiteTokenProviderScheme));
 
+  // Domicile's engine fork. A domicile:// document fetch()es its own files,
+  // such as the splash's progress.json; without this Blink refuses the scheme
+  // before any loader sees the request. ShellURLLoaderFactory serves a file
+  // only to its own origin, so no other page can read one.
+  WebSecurityPolicy::RegisterURLSchemeAsSupportingFetchAPI(
+      WebString::FromAscii(domicile::kDomicileScheme));
+
   // This doesn't work in single-process mode.
   if (!base::CommandLine::ForCurrentProcess()->HasSwitch(
           switches::kSingleProcess)) {
